                {
                    "row": 1,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.1 Remarks on the accompanying documentation (none, or give comments): 1. A scanned copy of the test report in Arabic without a number dated 28 October 2025 and valid for three months has been provided. At the time of delivery on 1 February 2026, this report is no longer valid/Предоставлен скан-копия протокол испытаний на арабском языке без номера от 2025-10-28 сроком действия 3 месяца. На момент поставки 2026-02-01 данный протокол не действует.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 2,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.2. Remarks for visual, measurement and other inspections including Materials completeness (none, or give comments):1. According to test report No. 39-300-21/1B dated 2026-02-02 and item No. 1 of the Specification, Appendix No. 1 and Technical Assignment No. 1302-ARE-2025, the actual strength of the brick does not meet the requirements of grade M100/Согласно протоколу испытаний No39-300-21/1B от 2026-02-02 и п/п No 1 Спецификации Приложение No 1 и Технического задания No1302-АРЕ-2025, фактическая прочность кирпича не соответствует требованию марки М100.",
                    "gridspan": 5,
                    "vmerge": null,
                    "is_header": false,
                    "anchor": null
                },
                {
                    "row": 3,
                    "col": 0,
                    "text": "2.3. Remarks for preservation and/or anticorrosive coating (none, or give comments): NONE",
